Chelyabinsk 2013 (Popova+2013 Science, Brown+2013 Nature)  -- bolum v2 input deck
format:  key = value   # comment   (first two lines are skipped)
diameter       = 19.6       # m   (1.3e7 kg at 3300 kg/m^3)
